[center][size=4][color=#FFD700][b]🎉 v3.1.6-beta[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[size=3][b]重点：HDR 显示下的候选栏颜色修复[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][color=#CDC2DB]No more blown-out overlay under HDR[/color] — with Community Shaders' "HDR Display" feature active the swap chain back buffer holds PQ-encoded HDR10 values, and the candidate window (drawn into that buffer at present time so it stays above host menus) was writing plain sRGB colors into it — read back as PQ, white clipped and colors washed out. The overlay is now encoded the same way Community Shaders encodes the game's own UI (sRGB→linear→BT.2020→PQ, paper white taken from its settings), and only for HDR surfaces: 8-bit targets and the engine's UI buffer stay untouched, so the overlay matches the UI drawn next to it.
[color=#CDC2DB]HDR 显示下候选栏不再过曝[/color] —— 社区着色器（Community Shaders）开启 "HDR Display" 后，交换链背缓冲持有 PQ 编码的 HDR10 值，而候选窗（为压过宿主菜单直接画进该背缓冲）写入的是普通 sRGB 颜色——被按 PQ 解读后白色溢出、颜色发灰。现在浮层按社区着色器处理游戏自身 UI 的同一条链路编码（sRGB→线性→BT.2020→PQ，纸白取自其设置），且只对 HDR 表面生效：8 位目标与引擎 UI 缓冲保持原样，颜色与旁边的引擎 UI 一致。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]English, symbols and space type normally in SKSE Menu Framework fields[/color] — the engine reads the physical keyboard regardless of window focus, so every key also produces a game-side CharEvent; while the IME owns the keyboard that event is a pure echo and was being zeroed, while the injection path rejected ASCII by design ("the raw event delivers English"). With Microsoft's IME that assumption fails: switching to English with Shift does not close the keyboard compartment, and space, [i]-[/i] and [i]+[/i] are passed straight through — both paths dropped them. The two sides now share one decision: a printable ASCII character is injected exactly when its echo is suppressed, so every character travels exactly one path.
[color=#CDC2DB]SKSE Menu Framework 界面里英文、符号、空格恢复正常输入[/color] —— 引擎读物理键盘与窗口焦点无关，每个按键都会额外产生一个游戏侧 CharEvent；输入法掌键盘时它是纯回声、会被清零，而注入通道又按设计拒收 ASCII（理由是"英文由原始事件送达"）。对微软输入法该假设不成立：Shift 切英文并不关闭键盘隔间，空格、[i]-[/i]、[i]+[/i] 本就是直通字符——两条路都断。现在两侧共用同一判定：可打印 ASCII 恰在回声被抑制时注入，每个字符只走一条路。
[/list]

[size=3][b]修复[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]HDR 状态探测不依赖 DXGI 颜色空间查询（交换链只有 SetColorSpace1、没有 GetColorSpace，社区着色器的交换链代理也不实现 IDXGISwapChain3）：改为按当前绑定的渲染目标格式 + 社区着色器自身设置判定，其自动检测尚未落盘时用 IDXGIOutput6 的颜色空间兜底。
[*]HDR 着色器参数（纸白、UI 亮度）编译期烘入，无常量缓冲、无状态泄漏；浮层绘制结束由 ImGui 后端自动还原引擎管线状态。
[/list]

[size=3][b]已知问题[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]自绘 ImGui 模组界面（声明宿主通道）上，直通 ASCII（英文/符号）可能重复输入一次：引擎原始事件与提交队列各送一份。中文输入不受影响。
[/list]

[size=3][b]内部[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]HDR 判定逻辑与注入契约都抽成无 D3D 依赖的纯逻辑并接入单测（含用 D3DCompile 真实编译 PQ 着色器）；测试总数 63/63。
[/list]

